<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Trade balance for October.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Trade balance for October.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicator is expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR   PERIOD	PREVIOUS		  EXPECTED</p>
<p>					DATA			DATE</p>
<p>     Trade	  Oct   +8.3 bln, c/a -1.6 bln     Jan 3</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release date was a target.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
